      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON JOE (6) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 5 winner three back (19.24) at Temora over 330m. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. PA KETTLE (3) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (19.10) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Shapes as one to consider. DANNY KEEPING (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (25.90) in a Grade 5 at Gunnedah. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. DEL MAR MOXEY (2) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
